From: "chak-kei.lam" <chak-kei.lam@mediatek.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: mt7987: add mtkhnat driver support

immortalwrt 6.18 的 mt7987.dtsi 位于仓库内（target/linux/mediatek/dts），
因此 SoC 侧的 hnat 节点直接在 repo 补丁里挂载，不涉及内核补丁队列。
节点默认 disabled，由设备 DTS 启用。
---

--- a/target/linux/mediatek/dts/mt7987.dtsi
+++ b/target/linux/mediatek/dts/mt7987.dtsi
@@ -233,6 +233,16 @@
 					 STATUS_SET)>;
 			};
 		};
+		hnat: hnat@15000000 {
+			compatible = "mediatek,mtk-hnat_v5";
+			reg = <0 0x15100000 0 0x80000>;
+			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 198 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
+			resets = <&ethsys 0>;
+			reset-names = "mtketh";
+			mtketh-soc = <&eth>;
+			status = "disabled";
+		};
+
 	};
 
 	fan: pwm-fan {
